{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Todo-Cat 是一款以卡通貓咪為主題的待辦清單 App，適合想整理工作、日常生活與學習事項的讀者；貓咪會呼吸與自然眨眼，陪著你逐項完成任務。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-97.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>任務提醒與專注倒數</h2>\n<p>新增任務後可隨時編輯、完成或刪除，把工作、家務與學習計劃集中於一處。提醒可設為單次，或按每日、每週、每月及自訂間距重複，完成任務後未來通知會自動停止。輕點貓爪即可開始 25 分鐘專注倒數，時長可自行調整，支援的裝置可在鎖定畫面與動態島查看剩餘時間。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-342-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-343-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-547-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-345-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-346-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Todo-Cat</li><li>應用類別：Lifestyle</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/todo-cat/id1590485332?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T19:20:16.142727+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":273,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T18:58:21+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T00:18:25.675929+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T19:18:28.779240+00:00","content_hash":"1598a5c1cda4aa474d8714b192fbbc8db8b01300132b04c44cdc94c56d8b2742","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}